[{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Definition:0","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Definition","f":"Definition 1.1 — Standard form","f_ar":"تعريف 1.1 — Standard form","b":"A number is in <strong>standard form</strong> when written as \\( a\\times 10^{n} \\) with \\( 1\\le a\\lt 10 \\) and \\( n \\) an integer. Large numbers take a positive \\( n \\); small numbers (less than 1) take a negative \\( n \\).","b_ar":"A number is in <strong>standard form</strong> when written as \\( a\\times 10^{n} \\) with \\( 1\\le a\\lt 10 \\) and \\( n \\) an integer. Large numbers take a positive \\( n \\); small numbers (less than 1) take a negative \\( n \\)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:1","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Percentage change","f_ar":"Percentage change (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"\\( \\dfrac{\\text{change}}{\\text{original}}\\times 100\\% \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\dfrac{\\text{change}}{\\text{original}}\\times 100\\% \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:2","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Index law 1 — Product","f_ar":"Index law 1 — Product (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"\\( a^{m}\\,a^{n}=a^{m+n} \\)","b_ar":"\\( a^{m}\\,a^{n}=a^{m+n} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:3","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Index law 2 — Quotient","f_ar":"Index law 2 — Quotient (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"\\( \\dfrac{a^{m}}{a^{n}}=a^{m-n} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\dfrac{a^{m}}{a^{n}}=a^{m-n} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:4","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Index law 3 — Power","f_ar":"Index law 3 — Power (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"\\( (a^{m})^{n}=a^{mn} \\)","b_ar":"\\( (a^{m})^{n}=a^{mn} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:5","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Reverse %","f_ar":"Reverse % (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"\\( \\text{original}=\\dfrac{\\text{new value}}{1\\pm r} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\text{original}=\\dfrac{\\text{new value}}{1\\pm r} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:6","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Bounds","f_ar":"Bounds (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"value rounded to a unit lies within \\( \\pm\\tfrac12 \\) unit","b_ar":"value rounded to a unit lies within \\( \\pm\\tfrac12 \\) unit"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Definition:7","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Definition","f":"Surds <span class=\"tier-e\">\\(E\\)</span>","f_ar":"Surds <span class=\"tier-e\">\\(E\\)</span> (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"A <strong>surd</strong> is an irrational root left in exact form (e.g. \\(\\sqrt{3}\\)). Key rules: \\(\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}\\); \\(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{a}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{a}}{a}\\) (rationalising a denominator). To rationalise \\(\\dfrac{p}{a+\\sqrt{b}}\\), multiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate \\(a-\\sqrt{b}\\).","b_ar":"A <strong>surd</strong> is an irrational root left in exact form (e.g. \\(\\sqrt{3}\\)). Key rules: \\(\\sqrt{ab}=\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}\\); \\(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{a}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{a}}{a}\\) (rationalising a denominator). To rationalise \\(\\dfrac{p}{a+\\sqrt{b}}\\), multiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate \\(a-\\sqrt{b}\\)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:8","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Surd product","f_ar":"Surd product (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"\\(\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}=\\sqrt{ab}\\)","b_ar":"\\(\\sqrt{a}\\cdot\\sqrt{b}=\\sqrt{ab}\\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:9","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Rationalise","f_ar":"Rationalise (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"\\(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{a}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{a}}{a}\\)","b_ar":"\\(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{a}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{a}}{a}\\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:10","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Compound interest","f_ar":"Compound interest (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)","b":"\\(A=P\\!\\left(1+\\dfrac{r}{100}\\right)^{\\!n}\\)","b_ar":"\\(A=P\\!\\left(1+\\dfrac{r}{100}\\right)^{\\!n}\\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-number:Formula:11","ch":"ig-number","chEn":"Number","chAr":"الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب","tag":"Formula","f":"Limits of accuracy","f_ar":"النهايات of accuracy","b":"lower = \\(x-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\delta\\), upper = \\(x+\\tfrac{1}{2}\\delta\\)","b_ar":"lower = \\(x-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\delta\\), upper = \\(x+\\tfrac{1}{2}\\delta\\) (الأعداد والعمليات الحسابية والنسب)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Definition:12","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Definition","f":"Definition 2.1 — Factorising a quadratic","f_ar":"تعريف 2.1 — Factorising a quadratic","b":"To factorise \\( x^{2}+bx+c \\), find two numbers that <strong>multiply to \\( c \\)</strong> and <strong>add to \\( b \\)</strong>. They become the constants in \\( (x+p)(x+q) \\).","b_ar":"To factorise \\( x^{2}+bx+c \\), find two numbers that <strong>multiply to \\( c \\)</strong> and <strong>add to \\( b \\)</strong>. They become the constants in \\( (x+p)(x+q) \\)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Formula:13","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Formula","f":"Difference of squares","f_ar":"Difference of squares (الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية)","b":"\\( a^{2}-b^{2}=(a-b)(a+b) \\)","b_ar":"\\( a^{2}-b^{2}=(a-b)(a+b) \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Formula:14","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Formula","f":"Quadratic formula","f_ar":"Quadratic الصيغة","b":"\\( x=\\dfrac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{b^{2}-4ac}}{2a} \\)","b_ar":"\\( x=\\dfrac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{b^{2}-4ac}}{2a} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Formula:15","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Formula","f":"Arithmetic nth term","f_ar":"Arithmetic nth term (الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية)","b":"\\( a+(n-1)d \\)","b_ar":"\\( a+(n-1)d \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Formula:16","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Formula","f":"Rearranging","f_ar":"Rearranging (الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية)","b":"apply inverse operations to <em>both</em> sides","b_ar":"apply inverse operations to <em>both</em> sides"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Definition:17","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Definition","f":"Sequences & nth Term","f_ar":"المتتاليات و nth Term","b":"An <strong>arithmetic sequence</strong> increases/decreases by a fixed common difference \\(d\\). The \\(n\\)th term is \\(u_n = a+(n-1)d\\) where \\(a\\) is the first term. A <strong>geometric sequence</strong> multiplies by a common ratio \\(r\\): \\(u_n=ar^{n-1}\\).","b_ar":"An <strong>arithmetic sequence</strong> increases/decreases by a fixed common difference \\(d\\). The \\(n\\)th term is \\(u_n = a+(n-1)d\\) where \\(a\\) is the first term. A <strong>geometric sequence</strong> multiplies by a common ratio \\(r\\): \\(u_n=ar^{n-1}\\)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Formula:18","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Formula","f":"Arithmetic \\(u_n\\)","f_ar":"Arithmetic \\(u_n\\) (الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية)","b":"\\(a+(n-1)d\\)","b_ar":"\\(a+(n-1)d\\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Formula:19","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Formula","f":"Geometric \\(u_n\\)","f_ar":"Geometric \\(u_n\\) (الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية)","b":"\\(ar^{n-1}\\)","b_ar":"\\(ar^{n-1}\\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Formula:20","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Formula","f":"Linear inequality","f_ar":"Linear المتباينة","b":"Flip sign when multiplying/dividing by negative","b_ar":"Flip sign when multiplying/dividing by negative"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Formula:21","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Formula","f":"Graph types","f_ar":"التمثيل البياني types","b":"linear, quadratic (∪∩), cubic (S), reciprocal (1/x)","b_ar":"linear, quadratic (∪∩), cubic (S), reciprocal (1/x)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-algebra:Definition:22","ch":"ig-algebra","chEn":"Algebra & Graphs","chAr":"الجبر والتمثيلات البيانية","tag":"Definition","f":"Linear Inequalities & Graph Recognition <span class=\"tier-e\">\\(E\\)</span>","f_ar":"Linear المتباينات و التمثيل البياني Recognition <span class=\"tier-e\">\\(E\\)</span>","b":"Solve like an equation but <strong>reverse the inequality sign</strong> when multiplying or dividing by a negative number. Graph types you must recognise: <em>linear</em> \\(y=mx+c\\) (straight line), <em>quadratic</em> \\(y=ax^2+bx+c\\) (parabola), <em>cubic</em> \\(y=ax^3+\\ldots\\) (S-shape), <em>reciprocal</em> \\(y=\\dfrac{k}{x}\\) (two branches), <em>exponential</em> \\(y=a^x\\) (crosses \\(y\\)-axis at 1).","b_ar":"Solve like an equation but <strong>reverse the inequality sign</strong> when multiplying or dividing by a negative number. Graph types you must recognise: <em>linear</em> \\(y=mx+c\\) (straight line), <em>quadratic</em> \\(y=ax^2+bx+c\\) (parabola), <em>cubic</em> \\(y=ax^3+\\ldots\\) (S-shape), <em>reciprocal</em> \\(y=\\dfrac{k}{x}\\) (two branches), <em>exponential</em> \\(y=a^x\\) (crosses \\(y\\)-axis at 1)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Theorem:23","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Theorem","f":"Reference — Coordinate Geometry","f_ar":"مرجع — الهندسة الإحداثية","b":"For points \\((x_1,y_1)\\) and \\((x_2,y_2)\\): gradient \\(m=\\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\); midpoint \\(=\\!\\left(\\dfrac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\dfrac{y_1+y_2}{2}\\right)\\); distance \\(=\\!\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2}\\). Two lines are <strong>parallel</strong> if they have equal gradients. Two lines are <strong>perpendicular</strong> if the product of their gradients is \\(-1\\): \\(m_1\\times m_2=-1\\).","b_ar":"For points \\((x_1,y_1)\\) and \\((x_2,y_2)\\): gradient \\(m=\\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\); midpoint \\(=\\!\\left(\\dfrac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\dfrac{y_1+y_2}{2}\\right)\\); distance \\(=\\!\\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2}\\). Two lines are <strong>parallel</strong> if they have equal gradients. Two lines are <strong>perpendicular</strong> if the product of their gradients is \\(-1\\): \\(m_1\\times m_2=-1\\)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Formula:24","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Perpendicular gradient","f_ar":"Perpendicular gradient (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)","b":"\\(m_\\perp=-\\dfrac{1}{m}\\)","b_ar":"\\(m_\\perp=-\\dfrac{1}{m}\\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Formula:25","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Parallel lines","f_ar":"Parallel lines (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)","b":"\\(m_1=m_2\\)","b_ar":"\\(m_1=m_2\\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Formula:26","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"General line","f_ar":"General line (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)","b":"\\(ax+by=c\\)","b_ar":"\\(ax+by=c\\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Formula:27","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Intercepts","f_ar":"Intercepts (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)","b":"Set \\(y=0\\) or \\(x=0\\)","b_ar":"Set \\(y=0\\) or \\(x=0\\) (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Formula:28","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Gradient","f_ar":"Gradient (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)","b":"\\( m=\\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1} \\)","b_ar":"\\( m=\\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Formula:29","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Midpoint","f_ar":"Midpoint (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)","b":"\\( \\Big(\\dfrac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\,\\dfrac{y_1+y_2}{2}\\Big) \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\Big(\\dfrac{x_1+x_2}{2},\\,\\dfrac{y_1+y_2}{2}\\Big) \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Formula:30","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Distance","f_ar":"Distance (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)","b":"\\( \\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2} \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2+(y_2-y_1)^2} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-coordinate:Formula:31","ch":"ig-coordinate","chEn":"Coordinate Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم","tag":"Formula","f":"Straight line","f_ar":"Straight line (الهندسة الإحداثية ومعادلات المستقيم)","b":"\\( y=mx+c \\)","b_ar":"\\( y=mx+c \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-mensuration:Theorem:32","ch":"ig-mensuration","chEn":"Mensuration","chAr":"القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم","tag":"Theorem","f":"Reference — The circle","f_ar":"مرجع — معادلة الدائرة","b":"Circumference \\( C=2\\pi r=\\pi d \\); area \\( A=\\pi r^{2} \\). An arc and sector are simply fractions of these, scaled by \\( \\dfrac{\\theta}{360} \\).","b_ar":"Circumference \\( C=2\\pi r=\\pi d \\); area \\( A=\\pi r^{2} \\). An arc and sector are simply fractions of these, scaled by \\( \\dfrac{\\theta}{360} \\)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-mensuration:Formula:33","ch":"ig-mensuration","chEn":"Mensuration","chAr":"القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم","tag":"Formula","f":"Circle","f_ar":"الدائرة","b":"\\( C=2\\pi r,\\quad A=\\pi r^{2} \\)","b_ar":"\\( C=2\\pi r,\\quad A=\\pi r^{2} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-mensuration:Formula:34","ch":"ig-mensuration","chEn":"Mensuration","chAr":"القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم","tag":"Formula","f":"Cylinder","f_ar":"Cylinder (القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم)","b":"\\( V=\\pi r^{2}h \\)","b_ar":"\\( V=\\pi r^{2}h \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-mensuration:Formula:35","ch":"ig-mensuration","chEn":"Mensuration","chAr":"القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم","tag":"Formula","f":"Sphere","f_ar":"Sphere (القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم)","b":"\\( V=\\tfrac{4}{3}\\pi r^{3} \\)","b_ar":"\\( V=\\tfrac{4}{3}\\pi r^{3} \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-mensuration:Formula:36","ch":"ig-mensuration","chEn":"Mensuration","chAr":"القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم","tag":"Formula","f":"Cone","f_ar":"Cone (القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم)","b":"\\( V=\\tfrac{1}{3}\\pi r^{2}h \\)","b_ar":"\\( V=\\tfrac{1}{3}\\pi r^{2}h \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-mensuration:Formula:37","ch":"ig-mensuration","chEn":"Mensuration","chAr":"القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم","tag":"Formula","f":"Prism","f_ar":"Prism (القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم)","b":"\\( V=A_{\\text{cross}}\\times \\ell \\)","b_ar":"\\( V=A_{\\text{cross}}\\times \\ell \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-mensuration:Formula:38","ch":"ig-mensuration","chEn":"Mensuration","chAr":"القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم","tag":"Formula","f":"Trapezium","f_ar":"Trapezium (القياسات الهندسية: المحيط والمساحة والحجم)","b":"\\( A=\\tfrac12(a+b)h \\)","b_ar":"\\( A=\\tfrac12(a+b)h \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-geometry:Theorem:39","ch":"ig-geometry","chEn":"Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية ونظريات الدائرة","tag":"Theorem","f":"Reference — Polygons","f_ar":"مرجع — المضلعات ونظريات الدائرة","b":"Interior angles of an \\( n \\)-sided polygon sum to \\( (n-2)\\times 180^{\\circ} \\). The exterior angles always sum to \\( 360^{\\circ} \\), so a regular polygon has each exterior angle \\( \\dfrac{360^{\\circ}}{n} \\).","b_ar":"Interior angles of an \\( n \\)-sided polygon sum to \\( (n-2)\\times 180^{\\circ} \\). The exterior angles always sum to \\( 360^{\\circ} \\), so a regular polygon has each exterior angle \\( \\dfrac{360^{\\circ}}{n} \\)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-geometry:Theorem:40","ch":"ig-geometry","chEn":"Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية ونظريات الدائرة","tag":"Theorem","f":"Reference — Circle theorems","f_ar":"مرجع — نظريات الدائرة","b":"① The angle at the centre is <em>twice</em> the angle at the circumference on the same arc. ② The angle in a semicircle is \\( 90^{\\circ} \\). ③ Angles in the same segment are equal. ④ Opposite angles of a cyclic quadrilateral sum to \\( 180^{\\circ} \\). ⑤ A tangent meets the radius at \\( 90^{\\circ} \\).","b_ar":"① The angle at the centre is <em>twice</em> the angle at the circumference on the same arc. ② The angle in a semicircle is \\( 90^{\\circ} \\). ③ Angles in the same segment are equal. ④ Opposite angles of a cyclic quadrilateral sum to \\( 180^{\\circ} \\). ⑤ A tangent meets the radius at \\( 90^{\\circ} \\)."},{"id":"igcse:ig-geometry:Formula:41","ch":"ig-geometry","chEn":"Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية ونظريات الدائرة","tag":"Formula","f":"Triangle angle sum","f_ar":"المثلث الزاوية sum","b":"\\( \\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma=180° \\)","b_ar":"\\( \\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma=180° \\)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-geometry:Formula:42","ch":"ig-geometry","chEn":"Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية ونظريات الدائرة","tag":"Formula","f":"Exterior angle","f_ar":"Exterior الزاوية","b":"Exterior \\( = \\) sum of two non-adjacent interior angles","b_ar":"Exterior \\( = \\) sum of two non-adjacent interior angles"},{"id":"igcse:ig-geometry:Formula:43","ch":"ig-geometry","chEn":"Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية ونظريات الدائرة","tag":"Formula","f":"Polygon angle sum","f_ar":"Polygon الزاوية sum","b":"\\( S=(n-2)\\times180° \\); each interior \\( =\\frac{S}{n} \\) (regular)","b_ar":"\\( S=(n-2)\\times180° \\); each interior \\( =\\frac{S}{n} \\) (regular)"},{"id":"igcse:ig-geometry:Formula:44","ch":"ig-geometry","chEn":"Geometry","chAr":"الهندسة المستوية ونظريات الدائرة","tag":"Formula","f":"Parallel line angles","f_ar":"الموازي المستقيم الزوايا","b":"Alternate = equal; co-interior \\( = 180° \\); corresponding = equal","b_ar":"Alternate = equal; co-interior \\( = 180° \\); corresponding = equal"}]